cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Precedent or the ideas behind it, please cite it as below."
title: "Precedent: pull requests for AI judgment"
abstract: >
  Human corrections to an LLM judge become scoped, versioned rules that must
  pass a blocking gate (no regressions, counter-examples, held-out agreement),
  need a second approver, and can be reverted; every step is recorded in a
  hash-chained event log.
